><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 행사개요</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 행사명 : 2013 공학교육페스티벌(E2 Festa 2013)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 주제 : 공학, 창조의 열쇠(Engineering, Key to Creation)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 일시/장소 : 2013. 11. 28.(목)~29.(금)/부산 벡스코 제 2전시장 외</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 참석대상 : 공과대학생, 교수, 공학인, 기업인, 중？고등학생 등</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 주최 : 교육부</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 주관 : 한국산업기술진흥원, 공학교육혁신협의회</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 운영 프로그램</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">○ 첨부파일 \"공학교육페스티벌 안내문\"활용하여 확인</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LIN